# Tab group colors for the tmux status bar: the personal colors layer.
# This directory (tab-colors.d/) is read whole, every file, sorted by
# name; other layers (other tools, work, per-machine) are sibling files.
# Read by the 'Tmux > Window > Color' palette entry.
# Format: <name> <value>, one per line; value is either a hex code
# (#rrggbb, fixed everywhere) or a terminal palette color (colourN,
# drawn with whatever palette the running terminal has). Lines
# starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored; file order is
# picker order. Hex section is sorted by hue.

